cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, cite the repository and the commit used."
title: "Generalized equipartition theorem in Lean"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - given-names: Neil Yuanting
    family-names: Li
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/N-Y-L/generalized-equipartition-lean"
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 proof of generalized canonical equipartition for differentiable
  Hamiltonians on finite-dimensional Cartesian phase space, under explicit
  integrability and boundary conditions. Includes the normalized Gibbs
  measure, boundary corrections, and a quadratic example with all analytic
  conditions proved.
